[h1]multiplayer-undo[/h1]
Rewind combat together in Slay the Spire 2. Choose an earlier point from the action history or restart the current fight, while keeping the multiplayer room and connections.

[h2]How to use[/h2]
[list]
[*]During combat, press [b]Left Arrow[/b] to open the history window.
[*]Choose an earlier point, or select [b]Restart Combat[/b].
[*]In multiplayer, the proposer automatically agrees. Every other player must accept before undo starts.
[*]You do not need to wait for current actions to finish. The history window stays open when another player acts.
[*]After replay finishes for everyone, continue playing from the restored point.
[/list]

[h2]v0.1.15 — faster restoration[/h2]
[list]
[*]Replays the native combat model without rebuilding combat UI for every action, then constructs the restored UI once.
[*]Keeps native actions, card/pile hooks, damage, RNG and recorded choices. Only replay presentation is skipped.
[*]Restores the hand, health, enemy intents, End Turn button, map and orb displays from the computed state.
[*]Keeps the existing multiplayer room and final restored-result checks before everyone resumes.
[*]One measured local 3-player ENet test of the same 500-action Finesse record: 159.020 seconds in v0.1.14 → 1.024 seconds in v0.1.15, including restoration and input release. This is one workload, not a timing guarantee for every fight or Steam connection.
[/list]

[h2]Before playing[/h2]
[list]
[*]Every participant must enable the mod, update to [b]v0.1.15[/b], and restart the game. Use the same version on every participant.
[*]History is kept in memory and is not saved between game sessions.
[*]This version passed local 3-player ENet repeated undo, choices/enemy turns, 3 timing-fuzz seeds with 9 undo operations, failure propagation and the 500-action test. Steam P2P across separate computers has not been verified.
[/list]

[h2]Languages[/h2]
English, Korean, Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese. Each player sees the UI in their own game language. Other languages use English.

[h2]한국어[/h2]
전투 중 [b]왼쪽 방향키[/b]를 눌러 히스토리를 열고, 원하는 시점이나 [b]전투 처음부터[/b]를 선택하세요. 제안자는 자동 동의하며, 나머지 전원이 수락하면 되돌립니다. 현재 행동이 끝나길 기다릴 필요가 없고, 다른 플레이어가 행동해도 선택창은 유지됩니다. 복원 중에는 검은 화면 중앙에 [b]복원 중…[/b]이 표시됩니다. 재생 중 화면 효과를 생략하고 마지막에 UI를 복원해 속도를 개선했습니다. 기존 액션 처리와 멀티 방을 유지하며 복원 후 결과를 확인합니다. 모든 참가자가 [b]v0.1.15[/b]로 업데이트한 뒤 게임을 다시 실행해야 합니다.

[h2]简体中文[/h2]
战斗中按[b]左方向键[/b]打开历史，选择要回退的时点，或选择[b]重新开始战斗[/b]。提议者自动同意，其余玩家全部接受后开始回退。无需等待当前行动结束，其他玩家行动时历史窗口也会保持打开。恢复期间，黑屏中央会显示[b]正在恢复……[/b]。重放期间跳过画面效果，完成后一次性恢复界面，以加快回退。保留原有动作处理和多人房间，并在重放后检查恢复结果。所有玩家均须更新至[b]v0.1.15[/b]并重启游戏。

[h2]繁體中文[/h2]
戰鬥中按[b]左方向鍵[/b]開啟歷史，選擇要回溯的時間點，或選擇[b]重新開始戰鬥[/b]。提議者自動同意，其餘玩家全部接受後開始回溯。無須等待目前行動結束，其他玩家行動時歷史視窗也會保持開啟。還原期間，黑畫面中央會顯示[b]正在還原……[/b]。重播期間略過畫面效果，完成後一次還原介面，以加快回溯。保留原有動作處理與多人房間，並在重播後檢查還原結果。所有玩家均須更新至[b]v0.1.15[/b]並重新啟動遊戲。

